bate as a quality ga"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"te**: every claim is challenged by independent \"departments,\" contradictions are surfaced explicitly"},{"id":"p7s3","text":", and final conclusions carry **per-claim confidence annotations** (e.g., `\"42/77 papers, high confi"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"al conclusions carry **per-claim confidence annotations** (e.g., `\"42/77 papers, high confidence\"`)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Dimension | Single LLM (ChatGPT) | Elicit / Consensus.app | **Consensus Pipeline** |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| **Core Mechanism** | One-shot generation | Single-pass extraction | **11-Department Adversarial De"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"bate** |\n| **Stopping Rule** | Single turn | Fixed top-$k$ retrieval | **Dynamic Convergence ($CV$ +"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" Kendall's $W$)** |\n| **Contradictions** | Flattened / averaged out | Listed side-by-side | **Cross-"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"examined across methodological perspectives** |\n| **Citation Audit** | Hallucination-prone | Abstrac"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"t snippet match | **2-Stage NLI (Abstract + Full-Text) & Mismatch Tagging** |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 📸 What It Looks Like"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Step 1: Requirement Interview\nThe pipeline starts by interviewing you — an AI agent asks clarify"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ing questions to understand your research scope, constraints, and goals."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 🎯 Core Capabilities"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**The pipeline in one sentence:** Search papers → 3-layer QC filter → 11 departments debate each cla"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"im → cross-department validation → generate confidence-annotated report with NLI citation verificati"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"→ cross-department validation → generate confidence-annotated report with NLI citation verification."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- 🔍 **Multi-Source Paper Search & 3-Layer QC** — Queries OpenAlex + Semantic Scholar + arXiv with au"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"tomatic deduplication, followed by a `hard_filter → LLM_classify → tag_layer` sieve (~65% off-topic "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"exclusion rate).\n- 🏛️ **11-Department Adversarial Debate** — 2–4 specialized debaters per department"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" with cross-department consensus handoff (eliminating isolated debate silos) and dynamic convergence"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" ($CV$ + Kendall's $W$).\n- 📊 **Per-Claim Confidence & Faithful Paraphrase** — Every conclusion is ta"},{"id":"p14s6","text":"gged with supporting paper counts; strict transcription rules prevent fabricated data levels or mech"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"anism directions.\n- ✅ **Two-Stage NLI Citation Verification** — Every claim is checked against retri"},{"id":"p14s8","text":"eved abstracts and full texts, explicitly distinguishing **citation mismatch (⚠️ wrong paper)** from"},{"id":"p14s9","text":" **overstatement (✂️ wording too strong)** while excluding unverifiable claims (📖 needs-fulltext / 📭"},{"id":"p14s10","text":" title-only) from polluting confidence scores.\n- 📄 **Full-Text Breakpoint & Multi-Format Export** — "},{"id":"p14s11","text":"Auto-fetches OA full texts (Unpaywall/S2/OpenAlex), pauses at Phase 5.5 for interactive paywalled PD"},{"id":"p14s12","text":"F supplementation, and exports bilingual reports (Markdown / DOCX / PDF) plus runnable Python code."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"📋 Click to expand the complete 18-point technical feature checklist"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- ✅ Multi-source paper search (OpenAlex + Semantic Scholar + arXiv)\n- ✅ 3-layer QC: hard filter → LL"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"M classify → importance tagging (219 → 77 papers, ~65% exclusion)\n- ✅ 10–11 debate departments, each"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" with 2–4 debaters arguing from different perspectives\n- ✅ Multi-round debate with **dynamic termina"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"tion** — stance quantification ($CV$) + Kendall's $W$ agreement\n- ✅ Cross-department validation (one"},{"id":"p16s5","text":" department audits another's conclusions)\n- ✅ Per-claim confidence annotation (e.g., `\"42/77 papers,"},{"id":"p16s6","text":" high confidence\"`)\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### What's Still Rough\n- ⚠️ Some UI labels remain bilingual (Chinese/English mix) in English mode.\n-"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" ⚠️ No GPU required, but a full multi-department run is an offline batch job (time and token usage s"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"cale with paper count).\n- ⚠️ Cross-department pairing logic currently uses a basic two-layer fallbac"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"le with paper count).\n- ⚠️ Cross-department pairing logic currently uses a basic two-layer fallback."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 🏗️ How It Works"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Phase | Stage | What Happens |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| **0** | Requirement Interview | AI interviews you about scope, constraints & goals |\n| **0.5** | D"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"omain Config | AI generates domain config dynamically (zero hardcoding) |\n| **1–3** | Structuring & "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"Config | Scope extraction, multi-angle discussion & department config recommendation |\n| **3.5** | Q"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"C Gate | 3-layer quality filter: `hard_filter → LLM_classify → tag_layer` |\n| **4** | Paper Search |"},{"id":"p21s5","text":" OpenAlex + Semantic Scholar + arXiv — deduplication & abstract backfill |\n| **4.9** | Full-Text Fet"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ch | Auto-fetch OA full text (Unpaywall → Semantic Scholar → OpenAlex) |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## ⚙️ Configuration & Prerequisites"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- **Runtime:** Python 3.10+ (3.11+ recommended), `git`, internet access (no GPU or local database ne"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"eded).\n- **Environment Variables:**"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Variable | Required | Description |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` | ✅ Yes | API key for LLM calls (Register or use any OpenAI-compatible key) |\n|"},{"id":"p25s2","text":" `DEEPSEEK_MODEL` | No | Model override (e.g., `deepseek-v4-flash` for debate, `deepseek-v4-pro` for"},{"id":"p25s3","text":" verification) |\n| `EASYSCHOLAR_SECRET_KEY` | No | Optional enhanced journal ranking (falls back to "},{"id":"p25s4","text":"built-in 209-journal registry) |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Provider | API Endpoint | Tested Models |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| **DeepSeek** | `https://api.deepseek.com/v1` | `deepseek-v4-flash`, `deepseek-v4-pro` |\n| **OpenAI"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"** | `https://api.openai.com/v1` | `gpt-4o` |\n| **Custom** | Any OpenAI-compatible URL | Local or cl"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"oud OpenAI-compatible models |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
